# LIC rate crawl output.
#
# Everything in here is DERIVED data that the crawler scripts regenerate from
# LIC's own APIs, so it does not belong in version control. It is also large and
# grows fast: plan 833 alone produces ~130 KB across five CSVs, and there are
# 155 legacy plans to capture.
#
# The reproducible pipeline is what is committed:
#   backend/prisma/scripts/fetchLICRates.ts        base premium rates
#   backend/prisma/scripts/fetchLICRateBands.ts    half-year age bands
#   backend/prisma/scripts/fetchLICRebateBands.ts  sum-assured rebate bands
#   backend/prisma/scripts/fetchLICRiderRates.ts   rider rates
#   backend/prisma/scripts/fetchLICModeFactors.ts  premium mode factors
#   backend/prisma/seeds/seedPremiumRatesCsv.ts    writes them to the database
backend/lic-rate-export/
backend/*.log
frontend/next-start.log